{"name":"神里绫人","name_en":"Kamisato Ayato","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"此前听绫华屡次提起阁下，不料公务繁忙，直至今日才有机会相见。神里家家主，神里绫人，今后请多指教了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/aac55b239d9028b0b8b855a04fc1d76f_3269596688325033497.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/dda8ab7683bf317a3c59d9b176ed96df_5383983492084164866.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b49ec20dcd62a4bd882b6c645472eb10_8396970547720404906.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1779e570c9ccf82ab03b612608b258bc_6679753636803232926.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·大少爷","title_en":"","text":"好像忘带什么东西了…算了，等想起来的时候再差人送来好了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d146d84a51e7473b512a47b20037a1e9_1783390273570173961.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/7b420ec75d28bbca30c762aae2280549_1050438933830930809.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b595d6923bb7531018682b286d553966_5995914612759677551.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/125be6e133a8d50722130a03414a0bf1_3980060137184455798.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·收网","title_en":"","text":"暗线已经布置妥当，嗯，差不多该收网了…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1ff07117c9ed5af69fbbf6540b18f995_1664232159553610636.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f5e73114cb173cd1108b9f64d1b0e750_3254808754447996417.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/af62164866a2d866d4ee3208d0aee9f0_1948493630047498239.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/053acd5d0871811fadd511f3d22fd49c_2487142022243185784.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·恶趣味","title_en":"","text":"一想起家臣们一脸焦急却又不敢开口阻拦的样子，就忍不住觉得有趣。呵，出来走走是不错。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b6b541a84a6992e899bd3e1a28465c2a_8097317173386833219.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d9c6df0578af9c438f64dc360d6250c2_5807162225164955027.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/48430afc20a934dd8f2671836ec39f81_4496160170112506423.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/16fc4d551aa7ee95313e68e33de70ed1_8464000128548452869.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雨的时候","title_en":"","text":"暂且先避下雨吧，不必着急，很快就会有人来送伞了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a48c8a4fea99d0009d17cae23c33b0d5_5039653255387985103.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/52bbef8f04548fedef21ee66a0dea37b_7519702962292497370.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2e9e3fd45e9ba22ad9d5719fb8ae4cdd_376086946067437938.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/0cef14bde39f6db52820584f8eb125ae_3719336984888538435.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"绫华自小害怕打雷，直到家母告诉她雷声是大御所大人的倾诉。从那时起，每逢打雷她都会神色专注，仿佛这样就能听懂大御所大人的言语。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d65627210fc4b3c3ce27381f3888958c_1794255446617160964.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/8b9debe77c7336859a6d14765fcba7de_1288273636165772261.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/27a23c98148a32eee7b18bf299c60619_4229551077839960382.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c5054954881b6bdcc33ea7f887808eae_3012006418759410648.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雪的时候","title_en":"","text":"如今的雪景，与多年前的那场雪…并无二致。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/471c39937893bd3a4650df7d0faf8403_730948144890687225.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/9724057cb9d8df9b3cdf292a6f65d7c3_4995178042567888946.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b682bbd3687c6b12096ed9386ac08b85_6133063261763027117.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/6490ce3d4658ef17b604f26e46e02ccd_8571447111529364696.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"阳光很好","title_en":"","text":"能悠闲晒太阳的时间可不多。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/37b39b7c8dd2aa9fab8336b196ca9cb8_4372710521049615590.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/fccfaf08ad233fef92dc8e79787431ed_7027451202664721603.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d6359b6207f057e0315e4cd65ea2d6e6_8278601579911396717.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b040e9c43bede1b663d4aac6e5ea2f8d_8323286348360821061.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"起风的时候","title_en":"","text":"有些「突发情况」，看似细小如微风，却会影响到最终结果…呵呵。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/be1cc3fc537fee9519773ef78e5f02ab_4891555214784803608.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/4455aefac2b945ab8c18757941d90efb_3087442407899388882.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/dc9e9c526c8229dfeae8fd1a442eac36_1339016172284650925.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/13de7ce55a7d00da71c8ab669a677879_4908540156305484768.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"刮大风了","title_en":"","text":"大多数人会因为大风迷眼而止步不前，只有少部分人能够借势而为。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2741275cae743c718054729006549565_8277193800517916275.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f30db97fcb5a3ccd055d5645134b2b9d_8911830620925041427.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/49f94a30a47a7b862593e976d5b1cd5f_6274762349089158144.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/984dc2e4ad8b87493cbd85d700963881_529378673213585673.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"早上好。清晨适宜练剑，放松身心。我一般不会让人安排公务。如何？要过上几招么？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a7f17f15a5d83f46853081679015b092_407177637483086161.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c3ae4fcd6f43167366cd8cc7b8f8a710_2362626263976222849.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d1708efff71593c35e602c37b5f9ad93_9210704787683581952.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a1611b9f567a80f8fdca58dead62ed4d_4494146839508294672.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"午饭如果有偏好的菜色，提前和家仆说就好。你是我的贵客，他们也应对你尽心尽力。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1db31d338cd07d8c08c59414a5602bfc_7215671216796718838.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/93b51d930076e16ba7df783f68e7ab61_9195482913473770881.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/45b4a9202a35d049ef378259c31554a5_308632119598582458.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3386c5e21e6d2a3925cb9831163ab8c8_2026378774968026203.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"既然在这个时间点找我，不如留下来吃晚饭吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3fb07168dfef4e50d4ab231638d917cb_6885627868736174585.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/90e9a99c462e1564fce7b8474e471cda_3686258565030048581.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a61bf2c133336db91d20704c97bdc9f7_7247223332421733152.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/8bd2e20066ec586dd7ea471d4be50626_8916456535486584111.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"到洗漱的时间了是吧，你先下去吧，我还不困…呃，是你？我最后再整理下今日的公务便好，你也早点休息。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/dbc5ac13f491027066c2b289878f0906_6307868850618167506.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a30c98fc1780b85a1db79208cab3383a_7823886921241821837.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/67457f27664483099eb4b86c09f2ca3d_726746394703324311.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3b6d69b67d00046cca459e6378698d9d_2079027818540396383.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于神里绫人自己·代价","title_en":"","text":"万事皆有代价。既然寻求常人无法企及之事，那就必然付出世人无法想象的代价。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f74b61dacd7ed5092b098ade3241bb7e_692673363627473307.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/87ad6947c640ca39aa9d61e72d683ccf_5700007302317159134.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2b8e0354ce9e60375e4d9de6d5c56a46_3422170140389038029.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/0aba644974fe7514339d5bebaae5515a_1787711014538535757.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于神里绫人自己·手段","title_en":"","text":"我并不是拘泥于手段的人，无论采取怎样的方式，只要能够取得合适的结果就好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/13766a2d20f5b3682d5239cf8f98f1ad_5612619621015683166.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f25e306ef699dca5de11f8a915011bcb_3581162679402273635.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/8234ce14db83bafabb0ce0b3830683f1_2908540800449524447.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/cf91aa9224ae234eef9a3b9ae21e3854_3281547072045144624.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·趣事","title_en":"","text":"呵，我听说了你们在天领奉行那边发生的趣事。能让九条老头气得掉头发的人，真不多见。只可惜没有亲眼见证这一幕啊…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/8d13958a747ffac8c8da89fb1a9a50c0_5838907757002737878.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/9abda90559cb9940add1a4e38e1bdfe0_2806762436783996021.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2dbbf84276ebe175528f0e3df295db9d_3254808754447996417.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e89bf7da4d2b03eb30c5b1360bced5a0_8048846599240178287.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·信任","title_en":"","text":"信任他人不是一件容易的事，特别是对于位居高位的人来说。一旦错付了，付出生命的代价也不算少见。不过，你已经给了我信任，那我自然也不该辜负。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/80eb83727d17153f9027d09e1afc74a7_3061109188694263370.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f463ad73e8c27d03079c6ab4ce53de39_3719857412684217359.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/42ccb4563088c266500535f0de5eb40a_6866693501074290767.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/531d6caa9033d8e12c5f5f1d29ee0271_9147695056159184320.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"既然有「神之眼」这么方便的道具，自然是要好好利用了。能在我的手中像这样焕发光辉，它也是高兴的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/abdcfd10d2ec7504c6e19065a5d2e167_8300104437890213332.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/9b6f5613477d2c391a8c69d940a9a155_3282663344550326821.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/515d665ab2343ff8c91ca54652868b39_3366429676796470160.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b2d7b55f812cf8c3f17b6433b330fe83_4965600119363778781.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享","title_en":"","text":"将落花投于暖炉之上，在炉火的炙烤下，花会短暂地恢复生机，最后一刻的红艳更是压火光一筹…倒也没有枉费短暂的一生。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1bfdf464cccf871569ee6f0bf7ed95ac_7242091031875130795.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e1c6c3b881cc384d41e2d25dfc420de9_3059996684012455757.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/06a09f5a49c9d79c0f5895a09af9e299_5428759080875803851.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/718779bf0812d51ed95260b09983df83_9016083945971671139.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"说起宠物的话，嗯，我更喜欢狗。猫自我主义的特征是不错，但只有狗会乖乖听从主人的命令。忠诚而又坦率，呵，真是惹人喜爱啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/4477565d7c60773f5c9c20a39fe2f378_6196935290450941780.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e61348f614e26c9671c29f249eb47be9_9120115241291149861.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d7824a88d172d24cf03db0d87b6547dc_3220484571127113097.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/36435142056f98eb1ae6afeea1293120_3621677634230831416.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于神里绫华","title_en":"","text":"我相信绫华的能力，但我也希望她能够保持一颗纯粹的心。权力斗争她不必参与，人世阴暗她也不必直面，这些理应由作为兄长的我来一一扫清…不小心说太多了，就当是你我之间的秘密吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/95418ef5f1b574ef7884b8c2fc93b97b_3699834983867179441.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/83ebfe63d0a83e7fe1a35d44147272a7_2388813011762424149.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c1e22a01d61a0da1b7663ea79bcfa4aa_4380154398657859243.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e7f52fb9418dbf05989ed715a6445c42_6338049787937849632.wav"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于托马","title_en":"","text":"托马对神里家的忠心毋庸置疑。很久以前我曾试探过他，如果不想往后被卷入无尽纷争的话，最好早日离开。他却还是留了下来，一直跟随着神里家，让我也省心不少。…现在，我完全信得过的人很少，托马算是一个。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/62acf1b7df3e4982707d41ee46662e5c_4492023640783287508.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/bfc4842c45dbf02673a8a6b102310580_5313144293655371258.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/bc4cdbaaceb23cffa9f83377b3420e00_1231569986830410362.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/405343e4de2e0ec93e242360488b0520_7529178302037740222.wav"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于早柚","title_en":"","text":"她平时看起来是懒散了点，但在适当的时机，却总能给予重要帮助。你应该再清楚不过了吧？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2bec7495625f038237d9faf84f4e678f_6636522196293983136.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f0cf09d6e72adc5127ea079790864503_301490108097654788.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/33928b16fa7cc460b0dbf28e0cc6dd71_1307495086374433334.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/8c21ad701fdbf1c3b471d878d6c043d9_7633658584438425388.wav"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于宵宫","title_en":"","text":"那位…为人爽朗的烟花店店主么？嗯…她和神里家往来还算密切。她和绫华年龄相仿，也很投缘。绫华恐怕也不会因为她的快人快语而困扰。毕竟绫华那孩子在小时候，就能坚定地守住本心。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/6f0f3352633ab317eba24d7f2518f88d_2115647973922898140.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/7868644a7231564a638ec61a72b9373d_5442251809211975861.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3cbbd4360ed881e0577ee2f31c135c99_34547839553463385.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/015071a9da5eeca110ab7651b1acf777_332982281736735054.wav"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于雷电将军","title_en":"","text":"为了追求「永恒」，将军大人以及整个稻妻，都付出了不小的代价。伤口需要时间来愈合，作为政局的调和者，我必然会尽到我的责任。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/6ba092be716f2b81520844aef3df4c7b_7038502303190351557.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/88f8c4ff7b4e022f1df513979d80d8c2_482229201322375571.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d9feadd66356021675a41734c444c8bd_7672807873237317907.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/85375637b40d684640cd2f6883b86778_3739264768101143380.wav"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于八重神子","title_en":"","text":"宫司大人于神里家有恩，可她却一直不太看得惯我，呵，恐怕你没少听她「那小子」「那小子」地称呼我吧。由于业务交集，我们偶有碰面，虽说大家各怀心思，但工作起来也称得上融洽。我并不讨厌这种感觉。嗯，与聪明人一起办事，效率就是会高得多。况且就算她再讨厌我，也不得不承认如果没有我，就没人能实现得了她那些「奇思妙想」了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3e57f38e9bfe778cdabcbdf5ec13a691_7848338955211644052.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/69169e88d92a3167b3f64e035e8446c0_7011686158608427745.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c9fc560954a42bc280bd08c35e13172c_5904595425500197220.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/4aad2e8e4bebc6c82621066d827c5b3e_1416663570647510120.wav"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于九条裟罗","title_en":"","text":"九条老头打得一手好算盘，磨砺出了一柄利剑。哼，只可惜，他没有算到，自己做不起这位执剑人。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/37ff722a56a157bfc1e993e8cb9ab246_8336245004911059878.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/cf3e76c682c0a42d83d9a93d56c3a152_8011686972455170056.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e7ebc30bdbf0d1458afea92b3ed873c0_2459911514944020479.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/aa9c9ff6e987a636b948f3a885f4e492_4435208966266067565.wav"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于枫原万叶","title_en":"","text":"枫原家曾是神里家的下属，神里家的先祖当年未能保护他们周全，到我这里，仍有义务照拂他。虽说无法助他重振家业，但帮他逃脱天领奉行的追捕这种事还是做得到的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/3dd32b67fbc29612338f3c4660962ec6_4786915406143686578.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/885ebd890514d4dd2efa635cb320aade_4307387483472297783.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/98a9c651ca60e2238f733067dc0dc499_7274597472745617917.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/6399c289b77337701a4516890ae7c698_903882285465721402.wav"}},"line":7},{"title":"关于荒泷一斗","title_en":"","text":"那家伙实在是个有趣的人。让温顺的鬼兜虫相互争斗，哈哈，有意思。嗯，虽然那次点拨实则是不经意之举，但没想到的是，他竟会直接与我称兄道弟，而且时至今日都还没发现我这位「绫人兄」的身份。呵呵，这样也好，我并不讨厌…单纯的人。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/25d730531766cb23d3caa96dc060c8ac_3628509544500283092.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1a8de5b431d467106dc4213395192081_3868549989534156622.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/dd122a624ea84880bb1e6f288506e636_8293366926157946111.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c37586734491cd34d53eeeb932fc270c_7526904265623542769.wav"}},"line":8},{"title":"关于凝光","title_en":"","text":"璃月七星中的那位「天权」大人，嗯，她的手段我也略有耳闻。说来，我还收藏有一套限量版的「璃月千年」，你感兴趣吗？我差人拿出来，我们下一盘如何？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/fa930b412d59fdb0bdeb4fe3219e0fcf_1134420575693335512.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/24cf50b47cd8dddafcaf3564c082d667_5959561492535909040.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/93a75179476756440c15b5dc8f4c9bb3_6370386824712822661.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/33dc38d3df7816b4aca01ac41f5a4e68_4204658773424918391.wav"}},"line":9},{"title":"想要了解神里绫人·其一","title_en":"","text":"我的事情吗？有时候知道得太多不一定是好事，你应该也听说过类似的谚语吧。下次有机会再聊吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e94db9fd8832ccf8ec12cc1b7e3d70d8_6356555623315370697.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/9e46585e56350050a2601ace2b07a49e_2301492885539576599.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/ab152f3613b538bfb5dd1c6618d46242_4984032482042384691.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/9d0c6a13ad41e96b615496b6de4d2d60_5955521296112317092.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解神里绫人·其二","title_en":"","text":"品味…奇特？看来你对我有什么误解，我得澄清一下才是。多数时候，我只是喜欢看人脸上为难的表情罢了。难道这很奇怪吗？你应该也没少逗你边上的小家伙吧？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/bbd5fae31c65d95570de914c2a079732_4494064030146768792.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/df131f25c00302f4c88bdbb6812a7a07_1529448214080255139.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/becb36f93e85f923e96313b80f4e7cb1_6338049787937849632.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e8565c2e92284f4a3d8e02498528f3f5_5914307069814206620.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解神里绫人·其三","title_en":"","text":"三奉行之间，表面看起来风平浪静，实际上却暗潮涌动。哼，和那些老家伙们周旋，并不是什么愉快的事，不值得细说。你只需知道…昔日是为了神里家的稳定，今日是为了稻妻的大局，我从未行有愧于神里家家主之名之事。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/efd90e2d9235b87347c2f4a10ff7cc64_8790477758895309301.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/0684046338736c09b13089ecb76a83f7_7494537766865220073.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/ad77dc2ab5a9acafc3d8302fdd199d82_3607072680154713457.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/4d6914f9ef2bd2098a43a322b3b66e5a_4254396141665515519.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解神里绫人·其四","title_en":"","text":"终末番吗？和你说说倒也无妨。那是直属于神里家家主的一支秘密部队，家父去世后，便由我接手了。我不能直接出面解决的事情，有了终末番就方便不少。里面的成员大多是孤儿，从小就被组织收养，这样才能最大程度保证忠诚，也能让人放心。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d850e5b5b60180ba74aeab6850a4cf25_1690035983480184360.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f74185f3dfd2c1011e12b02bc6200762_3845612274904021022.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/40a243793f572334787b12873c848eb4_5777985985486253132.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/4ea4acab9939843c1a7f1090ad2f70de_8388642919771170698.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解神里绫人·其五","title_en":"","text":"除了终末番以外的底牌？呵，自然是有的，狡兔有三窟，更何况人呢？只是我的秘密已经说得差不多了，该来听听你的故事了吧。哦对了，在提瓦特大陆上旅行的部分就不用了，说些更久之前的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/95fff9b1f2d27e3628482fac2e42526d_6871182265239155171.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/0b3685d5d5b8f4672832800f67c3f0c8_6132711454934922461.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/ce779faf4cd6fa3939dbd9105335500b_7487998515293229464.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/5d2d9905c9a9d7c789fe793fde125508_3550213591111667804.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"神里绫人的爱好","title_en":"","text":"爱好…小时候倒是略有一二，不过如今公务占据了大多数时间，不提也罢…嗯？你说有人把公务当成爱好？呵，这可真是…嗯…独特。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/699503eee8c75a9cf07b4c0f392d986f_6576731685455149279.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/b9ab42c841a8f30816473c4529cd2dfa_6279813458621574574.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f88ba2515cc2da009fddffb2917e07c3_7599503990721174246.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/2a07ebf89d545b20ed646222252038cb_4036365946464966074.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"神里绫人的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"烦恼吗？如果一件事让我烦恼，那就得尽快处理好。如果一个人让我烦恼，呵…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/c272c59515e28c2f0370a05b6212a99b_7038502303190351557.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/5da872ccbf77d35943c0bb976722adbc_5869981099236986937.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/80c993a3107ba76c38f5b7dc3d1f0a7d_7200640456613999415.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f85578825a91d182cc3c77f4245d05ec_1733536613037331879.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物·个人喜好","title_en":"","text":"新奇的事物能给枯燥的日常生活带来新鲜感。最近花见坂那边新出的什锦奶茶就很不错，你也该试试。不过…日常饭菜上我没有什么偏好。每日用餐有专门的下属制定计划。对方端来什么，我就吃什么。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d4a49fe22e7e21a11a1d2c473a45d862_8743586483302884332.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/413084e4b0be621f493212b3343f1d67_2910223260259941156.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/cc1c9803fa6981ff7dfe8137f757121b_5978205142636741825.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/5c9db8e6d6ab39de88f532a3885f3f1f_1394165137567679378.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物·新的尝试","title_en":"","text":"差不多可以告诉我你的口味了吧？嗯？原来是这样。嗯，我记下来了。下次被问起的时候，我也回答这个吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/d4799d88fdaa9eab53143fc5d88d2ce4_7714972287765855105.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/e719a008ef5d6a036200bd9a27863319_371722048627921263.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/04e6de9f3fff88731c18ec0e0588fc4a_3627772461523063635.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/08c12eec8f3a66943655f293671007c8_2603105293467545617.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"讨厌的食物","title_en":"","text":"…啊，盐和糖弄错了。咸的水馒头…嗯，也行，给托马吃吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/a2232c3254d42b1189abd7f01b3a1ed5_8510084071704866412.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/7a9ba95927d7da89f74a977456dba05e_1268734667059044782.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f414c0300588ccae095f2c4ed11a556d_6505960004739757853.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/24f19503a2e5ebf8fb4ea2ab411cecd4_5515231628707698014.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"生日","title_en":"","text":"生日快乐！让你体验一日社奉行，如何？哦，公务我提前处理完了，你只需要享受权力带来的乐趣就好。有我陪在你身边，料想家臣们也不敢说什么。呵，放心吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/7292a1f8f1605ab3dfaf5c433afb1940_6041925915997833863.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/1b5bf2fe70c20c99e7c0610d5aa111c4_4896872515953319270.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/f4f4769cb74f12c24699ba7f3f1798c0_1693738060783706552.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/dc4d982456be285eedf1e06c1a47e8c8_8022723826891174287.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"突破的感受·起","title_en":"","text":"能力提高了？呵，那可真是好事。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/65fd9e589bb82ad6786955ba264a74a8_1220464460984002125.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/28/47826599/6a20630c0a9b3d7fab38bc552cde865b_2332786145409726558.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.co